u = 24 m/s, v = 6 m/s, t = 6 s
</p>

<p><b>Step 2:</b></p>

<p>
v - u = 6 - 24 = -18 m/s
</p>

<p><b>Step 3:</b></p>

<p>
a = -18 / 6
</p>

<p>
a = <b>-3 m/s²</b>
</p>

