<p>First speed = 60 km/h</p>

<p><b>Step 2:</b></p>
<p>Second speed = 40 km/h</p>

<p><b>Step 3:</b></p>
<p>Relative speed = 60 + 40</p>

<p><b>Answer = 100 km/h</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

