<h2>Finding Meeting Time</h2>

<p>
When two objects start a known distance apart and move <b>towards each other</b>,
their separation decreases at their relative speed.
</p>

<p>
For objects moving towards each other:
</p>

<p>
<b>Relative speed = speed 1 + speed 2</b>
</p>

<p>
