<p><b>Step 1:</b></p>
<p>Relative speed = 30 + 20 = 50 km/h</p>

<p><b>Step 2:</b></p>
<p>Time = 100 / 50</p>

<p><b>Answer = 2 hours</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 3</h3>

<p>
