<p>d₁ = 60 × 2 = 120 km</p>

<p><b>Stage 2:</b></p>
<p>d₂ = 40 × 1 = 40 km</p>

<p><b>Total:</b></p>
<p>120 + 40 = <b>160 km</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

<p>
