</p>

<p><b>Stage 1:</b></p>
<p>d₁ = 20 × 3 = 60 km</p>

<p><b>Stage 2:</b></p>
<p>d₂ = 15 × 2 = 30 km</p>

<p><b>Total:</b></p>
<p>60 + 30 = <b>90 km</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 3</h3>

