<p>80 × 1 = 80 km</p>

<p><b>Stage 2:</b></p>
<p>60 × 2 = 120 km</p>

<p><b>Stage 3:</b></p>
<p>40 × 1.5 = 60 km</p>

<p><b>Total:</b></p>
<p>80 + 120 + 60 = <b>260 km</b></p>
