<p><b>Stage 1:</b></p>
<p>t₁ = 150 / 75 = 2 hours</p>

<p><b>Stage 2:</b></p>
<p>t₂ = 100 / 50 = 2 hours</p>

<p><b>Total:</b></p>
<p>2 + 2 = <b>4 hours</b></p>

<h3>Important</h3>

