<p>t₁ = 120/60 = 2 h</p>

<p><b>Stage 2:</b></p>
<p>t₂ = 100/50 = 2 h</p>

<p><b>Total:</b></p>
<p>2 + 2 = <b>4 hours</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

