<p>
t₁ = 180/60 = 3 h
</p>

<p>
t₂ = 120/40 = 3 h
</p>

<p>
Total time = 3 + 3
</p>

<p>
<b>Total time = 6 hours</b>
</p>

<h3>Worked Example 3</h3>

