2(4) + 5 ≤ 12
</p>

<p>
8 + 5 ≤ 12
</p>

<p>
13 ≤ 12
</p>

<p>
False.
</p>

<p>
Therefore the point is not feasible.
</p>

<h3>Important</h3>

<p>
Do not stop after finding one true inequality.
Check <b>every</b> constraint.
