<p>
Then count how often each occurs.
</p>

<table>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Frequency</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td>4</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>3</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>2</td>
