For the path HH:
</p>

<p>
P(H) = 1/2
</p>

<p>
P(H) = 1/2
</p>

<p>
Therefore:
</p>

<p>
P(HH) = 1/2 × 1/2
</p>

<p>
= 1/4
</p>

<h3>Example 2: Head followed by Tail</h3>

<p>
For HT:
</p>

<p>
P(H) = 1/2
</p>

<p>
P(T) = 1/2
</p>

<p>
Therefore:
</p>

<p>
P(HT) = 1/2 × 1/2
</p>

<p>
= <b>1/4</b>
</p>

