Which stage is most likely being observed?</p>

<p><b>Step 1:</b> Look for chromosome pairing.</p>
<p><b>Step 2:</b> Pairing of homologous chromosomes occurs during Prophase I.</p>

<p><b>Answer:</b> Prophase I.</p>

<h3>Key idea</h3>

<p>
Prophase I prepares homologous chromosomes for their separation in Meiosis I.
