<p>
Homologous chromosomes have separated and moved to opposite poles.
</p>

<p><b>Answer:</b> Homologous chromosome separation has occurred.</p>

<h3>What comes next?</h3>

<p>
The cell proceeds to <b>Meiosis II</b>, where sister chromatids will eventually
be separated.
