  <h2>Different Gametes Carry Different Genetic Combinations</h2>

  <h3>The problem with thinking of gametes as identical</h3>

  <p>
    It is incorrect to think that every sperm produced by a male contains
    exactly the same genetic combination.
  </p>

  <p>
