  <p>
    The aa parent can produce only:
  </p>

  <p>
    <b>a</b>
  </p>

  <p>
    The Aa parent can produce:
  </p>

  <p>
    <b>A</b> or <b>a</b>
  </p>

  <h3>Step 2: Combine the gametes</h3>

  <p>
    a + A = <b>Aa</b>
  </p>

  <p>
    a + a = <b>aa</b>
  </p>

  <h3>Step 3: Determine the expected proportions</h3>

  <p>
    <b>50% Aa</b>
  </p>

  <p>
    <b>50% aa</b>
  </p>

  <h3>Step 4: Determine the phenotypes</h3>

  <p>
    Aa → dominant phenotype
  </p>

  <p>
    aa → recessive phenotype
  </p>

