    Therefore:
  </p>

  <p>
    <b>50% dominant phenotype</b>
  </p>

  <p>
    <b>50% recessive phenotype</b>
  </p>

  <h3>Ratio</h3>

  <p>
    <b>Phenotypic ratio = 1 : 1</b>
