    If these insects survive and reproduce more successfully, the allele
    associated with the colour may become more common over generations.
  </p>

  <p>
    The population can therefore become better adapted to that environment.
  </p>

  <h3>Important</h3>

  <p>
    Individual organisms do not evolve because they need to.
    <b>Populations change over generations.</b>
