  <h2>What Is Biodiversity?</h2>

  <h3>DEEP NOTES</h3>

  <p>
  <b>Biodiversity</b> refers to the variety of living organisms in a particular
  area or on Earth as a whole.
  </p>

  <p>
  Biodiversity includes differences among organisms and the variety of species
  and ecosystems.
  </p>

