  <h2>What Is a Species?</h2>

  <h3>DEEP NOTES</h3>

  <p>
  A <b>species</b> is a group of organisms that can interbreed naturally
  and produce fertile offspring.
  </p>

  <h3>Example</h3>

  <p>
  Domestic dogs belong to the same species even though different breeds can
  look very different.
