<h2>Carnivores</h2>

<p>
A <b>carnivore</b> is a consumer that feeds mainly on other animals.
</p>

<h3>Examples</h3>

<ul>
<li>lion</li>
<li>cheetah</li>
<li>hawk</li>
<li>snake</li>
</ul>

