<p>
Mucus traps particles
</p>

<p>
↓
</p>

<p>
Cilia move mucus toward throat
</p>

<h3>KEY IDEA</h3>

<p>
Goblet cells and ciliated cells have different roles.
Goblet cells produce mucus; ciliated cells move it.
