<p>Plant B starts at 10 cm and reaches 18 cm after 4 days.</p>

<p>Change in length:</p>

<p>18 − 10 = 8 cm</p>

<p>Growth rate:</p>

<p>8 ÷ 4 = 2 cm/day</p>

<p>Plant A has greater total growth, but both plants have the same average growth rate.</p>

<h3>Why This Matters</h3>

<p>A question may ask for total growth or growth rate.</p>

<p>Do not answer one when the question asks for the other.</p>
