<p>This helps determine whether directional light is responsible for the bending.</p>

<h3>Improving Reliability</h3>

<p>Use several seedlings rather than one.</p>

<p>Repeat the experiment.</p>

<p>Calculate a mean where appropriate.</p>

<h3>Exam Rule</h3>

<p>A good experiment changes one main factor while keeping other relevant factors controlled.</p>
