<h2>Auxin and Root Growth</h2>

<h3>DEEP NOTES</h3>

<p>Auxin affects roots differently from shoots.</p>

<p>Roots are highly sensitive to auxin.</p>

<p>A relatively high concentration of auxin can inhibit root cell elongation.</p>

<p>A lower concentration can promote root growth within an appropriate range.</p>

