</ul>
<p>Many adverbs of manner end in <em>-ly</em>, but this is not a universal rule. <em>Fast</em>, <em>hard</em> and <em>well</em> can all function as adverbs of manner.</p>
<p>Be careful with adjectives after linking verbs:</p>
<p><em>The soup smells good.</em> Here, <em>good</em> describes the soup.</p>
